{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"4993d5ef353a74e7447e781b083f4c8d3f129908c6ad03ed29790fed0145ab75","ja":"アメちゃんのお返し","zh":"糖果的回礼","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a58bcb67188e986e6e0a8c1ee4f53ea63ad6d420f3cc1be4cb4cd7b799136e0e","ja":"（アクセント辞典、うがい薬、りんごはちみつ、\nネックウォーマー……これ、いったい何やろ……？）","zh":"（重音字典、漱口药、苹果蜂蜜、围脖……这些到底是什么呀……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"25ea198eec4a870c261deea32cced08423d1f5f87bb6ea2dcc9d4e3af5f2aedf","ja":"（あ、手紙もある……。「レッスンお疲れさま。\nアメちゃんのお礼に」って……みんなから！？）","zh":"（啊，还有信……“训练辛苦了。谢谢你的糖果”……是大家写的吗！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4d61ffce6e977fa51de9262d4d928d207ea16552a9038811de9634c4bf1f1be1","ja":"アメちゃんが、色んなものに変わって……。\nあははっ！　なんや、『笠地蔵』みたいやな！","zh":"糖果变成了各种各样的东西……  \n啊哈哈！这不就像《笠地藏》一样嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9c74331c9aa7c6cc56da72bc16fb90f726ac36374a2f5bbc9afd212f31b4a7c8","ja":"みんな……ホンマに、ありがとな。\n私、絶対セリフ完璧にしてみせるわ……！","zh":"大家……真的，非常感谢你们。\n我一定会把台词练到完美……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e1599a6990a99842fdc78af5f320d2fb386da80fbeaedbbf989b2fbf607f4639","ja":"数日後……。","zh":"几天后……。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9f389f7107fb483d04eb0f500f280dc995c394446df772417c4a6146246514f3","ja":"「ごめんなさい。私、記憶が……\nだから昔の事は、覚えてなくて」","zh":"“对不起。我……记不起事情了……\n所以，以前的事都不记得。”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d1272fd9e69fd5b9e6707dc91149463ea7a83bb765727a84cfa0ac12027aa8b7","ja":"「きっと、人違いだと思います。\n……行こう、逢路蘭（アウロラ）」","zh":"我想，一定是认错人了。  \n……走吧，逢路兰（アウロラ）。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"80dc7fdd138db063773b79021902c8cb8a77f4355bc93811fea3b978cb54ac55","ja":"わぁ～……！","zh":"哇～……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f5acdb8f3489a1c024cf869334e6761dedf87d5c4325d567758945f02678f453","ja":"え！？　環、そんなセリフやったっけ！？","zh":"诶！？环说过那种台词吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f3b43e57fd393a3b251085d5123462b973fbf6226c5351ee99ae87f1f4c47e9a","ja":"あっ……たまき、間違えちゃった！\nなおのお芝居見てたら、つい……。","zh":"啊……环，弄错了！\n看着奈绪演戏，一不小心就……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"4f9681e5d7fb3d6b1818bbc53cc0bbf04e096efaee4547cac0e6362d8b83c3a1","ja":"ふふっ、そうね。私も聞き入っちゃったわ。\n奈緒、すごくよかったわよ。","zh":"呵呵，是啊。我也听得入迷了。\n奈绪，表现得特别好哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"9fe6ab96921525931b781e99fa706ce9c16d67d64967290f0525155a899a5bd1","ja":"そうだねぇ。セリフが自然で、\n前よりすごく響いてきた気がしたよぉ。","zh":"是啊。台词很自然，感觉比以前更能打动人了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"48861e3ce3cc1f8495b86d988c400653ad5ed545445e2e9e3c1b4d69e5f5262a","ja":"ええ！　仕上げてきたわね、奈緒ちゃん！","zh":"是啊！完成得很漂亮呢，奈绪！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"eaa22af66be587790021a2bb728a7533ef62e6daa1cbb6817622a6d1449756ad","ja":"みんなの差し入れのおかげです～！　律子が\n用意してくれてたアクセント辞典、便利やったわ～！","zh":"这都是多亏了大家送来的慰问品～！　律子帮我准备的重音词典，真方便啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"a70b277b8cb04e9efc34cf94d635d48a544e8351164dcf510df7dbaba9c49e3c","ja":"このみさんのネックウォーマーに、環のうがい薬、\nひなたのりんごはちみつも……めっちゃ助かりました！","zh":"木实小姐的暖脖套、环的漱口药，还有日向的苹果蜂蜜……真是帮大忙了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"722e99c75a3673f8717b8cfb7dcdbe75eef41b9690b5fedd65a623e361222361","ja":"頑張ってる奈緒さんに、何かできればと思ってねぇ。\nけど、みんなも同じこと考えてて、びっくりしたよぉ。","zh":"我想着，要是能为一直努力的奈绪做点什么就好了。\n不过，没想到大家也都这么想，真是吓了一跳。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"bc7ad5439495013710d0ba3d13965975e04b3a03c5d09677918995a037bb9707","ja":"そうね。私もこっそり差し入れしようと思ったら……\n先にみんなが、素敵なの置いてるんだもの♪","zh":"是啊。我本来也想偷偷送点慰问品来着……结果大家已经先放好了这么棒的东西♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"d8ee7d4d2906999a476b22fbd216e0858cfe6099eefb2b08a48c2900615aa8ce","ja":"えへへ。豪華なお供え物、\nホンマにありがとうございましたっ！","zh":"嘿嘿。谢谢您送来这么丰盛的供品！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_992.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"d3c5750339bbc1b9af63779e17e405007a07771b48ba21f734b578569a7db520","ja":"このままツアー本番を絶好調で迎えられるように……\n私、さらに気合入れていきますねっ！","zh":"为了能以最佳状态迎接巡演正式演出……\n我会再加把劲的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
